WEBVTT

asr-000001
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So according to the standards of the Tobacco Laboratory Network, Mr. President.

asr-000002
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:09.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Ano yan? Sorry.

asr-000003
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:17.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So they're tested based on the standards of the Tobacco Laboratory Network.

asr-000004
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So may mga nag-fail.

asr-000005
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Diyos ko. May mga nag-fail. Tobacco Laboratory Network.

asr-000006
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Matatawa si Senator Aimee at the record show.

asr-000007
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Who is that?

asr-000008
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Who is the tabula?

asr-000009
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:52.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So this is the, that network has been identified by DOH as the gold standard for testing for these types of products.

asr-000010
00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:58.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000011
00:00:59.540 --> 00:00:59.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000012
00:00:59.640 --> 00:00:59.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The name

asr-000013
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:09.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sounds suspicious, so I'm sorry for that remark, but please know that I have been standing here for years listening to the most ridiculous answers.

asr-000014
00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So pagpasensyahan nyo na if I have so much doubts.

asr-000015
00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I will now raise my concern.

asr-000016
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ba nabanggit nyo yung isang laboratory sa China?

asr-000017
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:20.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The Shenzhen Element Testing Company Limited in Shenzhen.

asr-000018
00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:21.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In Shenzhen, China.

asr-000019
00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:22.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Oo.

asr-000020
00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:23.120
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000021
00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:25.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Shenzhen is known for a lot of ano ba?

asr-000022
00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:26.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Toys, garments.

asr-000023
00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:29.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I hate to have to ask.

asr-000024
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:41.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I hate to ask you this, Mr. Chairman, because the person who should be answering this is the subcommittee chair for Department of Health.

asr-000025
00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:48.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But since by law we gave it to DTI, the DTI will have to give their best answer to his honor.

asr-000026
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:55.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Is China the gold standard for healthcare when it comes to our counterpart in the FDA?

asr-000027
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:14.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, the, and again, this is according to our friends from DTI, these laboratories test based on the global standard.

asr-000028
00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:20.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So kung ang tanong po ay standard, iisa lang naman daw po yung standard sa mundo.

asr-000029
00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:25.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Now, if the question is, do these laboratories test it well or not, I guess that's a separate question, no?

asr-000030
00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, for the...

asr-000031
00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But the standard itself is set in the, set in the, set in the global standard.

asr-000032
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:38.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, and China is also the source of contaminated milk products, no?

asr-000033
00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And not that it doesn't happen all over the world.

asr-000034
00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.780
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ko ako galit sa China, to be clear.

asr-000035
00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ko ako, baka may ibang galit ako, di ko ako galit sa China.

asr-000036
00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But there are gold standards.

asr-000037
00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:58.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You can ask any FDA official and they will tell you that the gold standards are the US, some of the European countries, Japan.

asr-000038
00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May I inquire, Mr. President?

asr-000039
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: May I inquire, Mr. President, why these are the laboratories?

asr-000040
00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If you can give me a second.

asr-000041
00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:03.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes, please.

asr-000042
00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Why these laboratories?

asr-000043
00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:12.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: These are the only three

asr-000044
00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:12.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: in the world.

asr-000045
00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But it is Chinese.

asr-000046
00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:23.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So the product here, are you testing it?

asr-000047
00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Or are they set in China?

asr-000048
00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:29.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President,

asr-000049
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: if I may share the history, no, of this.

asr-000050
00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, initially, we didn't have any testing centers here.

asr-000051
00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, we did not.

asr-000052
00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The last update I had, wala.

asr-000053
00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:43.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, what the companies would use is this Shenzhen element testing.

asr-000054
00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:54.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But now that there are two centers here, most of the products are actually tested locally in the centers in Cavite and Quezon City.

asr-000055
00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:54.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000056
00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:58.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Who is it who's giving us the response, Mr. Chairman?

asr-000057
00:03:59.520 --> 00:03:59.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: The position?

asr-000058
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:12.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: This is Asec Valdez, who is the Asec in charge of tobacco, of vape, in particular.

asr-000059
00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, he is the Asec in charge of vape, Mr. President.

asr-000060
00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:16.600
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Thank you.

asr-000061
00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How long has he been with DTI and in charge of vapes?

asr-000062
00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:27.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DTI, 2021, and assigned to vape, 2024.

asr-000063
00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:28.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000064
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kasi, I'm not sure if Secretary was already the Secretary when I had asked that question.

asr-000065
00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:37.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And I already raised this issue of gold standard.

asr-000066
00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:40.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kung gusto talaga ng gold standard, may ibang gold standard.

asr-000067
00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Uulitin ko, and I'm sure, Secretary, you've heard me say this,

asr-000068
00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: that in the FDA,

asr-000069
00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:55.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: before I get that, because I'm having them check the number,

asr-000070
00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: sabi niyo, there are now two testing facilities.

asr-000071
00:04:58.680 --> 00:04:59.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Technically, there's only one.

asr-000072
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because the two that you mentioned, one is on the gadget, not on the liquid.

asr-000073
00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:05.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, isa lang yung sa liquid.

asr-000074
00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:08.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: La Primera Testing Center in Quezon City.

asr-000075
00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In QC, isa lang yung sa liquid.

asr-000076
00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:16.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Pero sabi niyo naman, this is approved by Tobacco Lab Network that I have no personal knowledge of.

asr-000077
00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:20.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, accredited or recommended by DOH, right?

asr-000078
00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:20.280
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-000079
00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:21.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I'll take that.

asr-000080
00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:25.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, sure tayo dyan, kasi tatanungin ko sa DOH yan bukas.

asr-000081
00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.160
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O kung kailan man si DOH.

asr-000083
00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:44.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, during the Blue Ribbon hearing that you led, Senator Pia,

asr-000084
00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:53.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: DOH said that we have to follow the TobLabNet standard.

asr-000085
00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:53.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000086
00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then, from there,

asr-000087
00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the Shenzhen...

asr-000088
00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:58.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Shenzhen was the first.

asr-000089
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then, itong La Primera are accredited by DTI.

asr-000090
00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:05.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, to be clear, it's DTI that accredits these laboratories

asr-000091
00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:11.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because these are the laboratories that can check based on the TobLabNet standards.

asr-000092
00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: To be clear, Mr. President.

asr-000093
00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I will just counter-check that with DOH.

asr-000094
00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:17.540
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, thank you for the explanation.

asr-000095
00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, as long as we will...

asr-000096
00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:26.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because I have a difficulty holding you accountable for a task that you have absolutely no training on.

asr-000097
00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:27.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Di ba?

asr-000098
00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:32.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Like, if I ask you na ano yung standards na yun, Sir, Mr. Valdez, no?

asr-000099
00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Asek Valdez, tama ba?

asr-000100
00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:34.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Valdez?

asr-000101
00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:34.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000102
00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:36.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Wala ka namang science background?

asr-000103
00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.220
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O, meron naman po.

asr-000104
00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.040
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: O, yun na nga, diba?

asr-000105
00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:44.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, normally, when I talk to the FDA, doktor yun, or public health expert.

asr-000106
00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, you understand why, if I had to interrogate you as a witness,

asr-000107
00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:53.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I will have a hard time recognizing you as an expert witness

asr-000108
00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: when it comes to the safety of e-cigarettes and ano.

asr-000109
00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:57.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You understand, Secretary?

asr-000110
00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: We've had this discussion.

asr-000111
00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:01.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are you nodding?

asr-000112
00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:03.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-000113
00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:10.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you understand my difficulty in attributing, accepting that may expertise ang DTI?

asr-000114
00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In terms of testing, they are not experts, Mr. President.

asr-000115
00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:16.440
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kaya nga eh.

asr-000116
00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:23.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, the waste of time I have to go through because I have to call DOH and FDI to make sure.

asr-000117
00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.260
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Because, how can you account for it?

asr-000118
00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You don't have the means.

asr-000119
00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You don't have the expertise.

asr-000120
00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:28.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: You don't have the expertise.

asr-000121
00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Even the chairman agrees with me.

asr-000122
00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Is that correct, Mr. Chairman?

asr-000123
00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:32.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yun lang.

asr-000124
00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:38.920
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, no judgment on anything else except your lack of expertise in this area.

asr-000125
00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If I tell you na when you go to that facility, what are you looking for?

asr-000126
00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:44.380
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you know what to look for, Mr. Valdez?

asr-000127
00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.140
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: What kind of equipment you're looking for?

asr-000128
00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:51.860
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How to know if that equipment can really do, can really...

asr-000129
00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:57.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, Mr. President, sa TOB LabNet standard, meron pong list of tests and machines.

asr-000130
00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That they counter-check with these centers.

asr-000131
00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's why they're accredited.

asr-000132
00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:01.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Correct.

asr-000133
00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it's the same way that you and I, Mr. Chairman, will do that.

asr-000134
00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.720
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Babasahin lang natin.

asr-000135
00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:06.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Diba?

asr-000136
00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:06.500
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yun lang nga.

asr-000137
00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, wala tayong expertise.

asr-000138
00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:08.940
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Aminin na natin.

asr-000139
00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:15.300
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't know how hard it is to elicit that admission.

asr-000140
00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:17.200
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Do you have the expertise?

asr-000141
00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Are you health experts?

asr-000142
00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: They're not health experts, Mr. President.

asr-000143
00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.680
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But they seem to have a hard time accepting that.

asr-000144
00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: For you, Mr. Chairman, without batting na na, you say it.

asr-000145
00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:27.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But sila?

asr-000146
00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:28.420
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I don't know.

asr-000147
00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:33.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, if I may add to this discussion, although I'm not sure if I should,

asr-000148
00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:43.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: but I think what we need to clarify talaga is they're treating vape like any other product, I think.

asr-000149
00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:47.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the way that you see it, and I agree with you, is that there are health implications to this product.

asr-000150
00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:48.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Exactly.

asr-000151
00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, that's it.

asr-000152
00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:51.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kaya tayo nag-iingat, diba?

asr-000153
00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:52.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Kaya tayo nag-iingat.

asr-000154
00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:53.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And kayo din naman po yung...

asr-000155
00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.180
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And it's not unfounded.

asr-000156
00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.700
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: There are reports all over the world of...

asr-000157
00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:01.080
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Honestly, youth that are having problems with vape.

asr-000158
00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:04.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And ano yan, Mr. President?

asr-000159
00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:08.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kunyari, kasi kung gamot yan, FDA yan.

asr-000160
00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:08.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Diba?

asr-000161
00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kung pagkain yan, FDA yan.

asr-000162
00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:12.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Right?

asr-000163
00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kasi Food and Drug Administration.

asr-000164
00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:17.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kapag mga gadgets yan, DTI yan.

asr-000165
00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, the question really is...

asr-000166
00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:23.020
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Before you proceed, Mr. President, I'll add to your examples.

asr-000167
00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.100
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yung pinapahid sa muka, FDA.

asr-000168
00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:25.520
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: FDA.

asr-000169
