Senator Pia S. Cayetano: If I have the answer, I will share.

asr-000198
00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tobacco products, is it with FDA or with DTI?

asr-000199
00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.740
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: That's a very long history, Mr. President.

asr-000200
00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.000
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, after something like, you can take a seat.

asr-000201
00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:54.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, I was the author of the law amending the food and drug, the existing food and drug law.

asr-000202
00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: I forgot the name.

asr-000203
00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:56.880
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But,

asr-000204
00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.960
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Yeah, yeah.

asr-000205
