asr-000206
00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, it created the FDA.

asr-000207
00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:19.840
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, there's a provision there that tobacco products should be governed by FDA, should fall under FDA.

asr-000208
00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, the tobacco companies brought it to court.

asr-000209
00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:23.540
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-000210
00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.460
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Sorry, the specific provision is, sorry, ang tagal na nito.

asr-000211
00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:34.800
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: But, anything that, to the effect that anything that affects health shall be under the FDA.

asr-000212
00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:39.560
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, the tobacco companies lobbied that it does not affect health.

asr-000213
00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: In the Philippines or in the Philippines?

asr-000214
00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.240
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: In the Philippines.

asr-000215
00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:47.640
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, a lower court agreed with the, if I remember my history correctly, okay.

asr-000216
00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:57.900
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And, a few years ago, the Supreme Court ruled that, no, it is the FDA because tobacco affects health.

asr-000217
00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:58.620
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-000218
00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.980
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: And then, nag-motion for reconsideration po yan.

asr-000219
00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:01.820
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Antay na naman tayo.

asr-000220
00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.580
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: Then, with finality, the Supreme Court ruled that tobacco affects health.

asr-000221
00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:06.340
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: How can it not?

asr-000222
00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.320
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: So, to answer your question.

asr-000223
00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It is with the FDA.

asr-000224
00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:10.400
Senator Pia S. Cayetano: It is with the FDA.

asr-000225
00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:18.580
