asr-001332
00:47:54.560 --> 00:47:57.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero to be continued daw yung

asr-001333
00:47:57.180 --> 00:47:58.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: pagbibilang.

asr-001334
00:47:58.420 --> 00:47:59.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, Mr. President, so...

asr-001334-split-2
00:47:59.500 --> 00:48:05.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ayun pa rin. Yun pa rin. Walang bago. I know, because during the hearing, nagbigay sila ng numero.

asr-001335
00:48:05.480 --> 00:48:14.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Lumiit nga, Mr. President, eh. Lumiit. Ngayon, 198 officially from BCDA. But if you remember, in our hearing, it was closer to...

asr-001335-split-2
00:48:14.220 --> 00:48:15.380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 400.

asr-001335-split-3
00:48:15.380 --> 00:48:16.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 400?

asr-001336
00:48:17.260 --> 00:48:21.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And honestly, Mr. President, latest reports have it higher to about 1,000.

asr-001337
00:48:21.320 --> 00:48:34.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Correct. So, it would be good, Mr. President, if maybe an independent agency like DSWD or NCIP could help us with identifying who are the possible families who will be affected.

asr-001338
00:48:34.920 --> 00:48:43.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because we want to make sure that if this initiative does push through, wala pong kababayan na masasagasaan o mapeperwisyo.

asr-001339
00:48:43.620 --> 00:48:50.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I'm sure you've heard, as well as Senator Padilla and myself, from the IPs, as well as the...

asr-001340
00:48:51.320 --> 00:49:03.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Residents, those in Tarlac and elsewhere, who are very, very concerned because they've really received notices to vacate and the request to sign quick claims and waivers.

asr-001341
00:49:03.920 --> 00:49:15.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Has BCDA determined the total amount necessary to compensate these people who will be affected in the loss of their homes, their agricultural land, their livelihood, their crops?

asr-001342
00:49:17.900 --> 00:49:19.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Meron na kayong estimate kung magkano ang kakailanganin?

asr-001343
00:49:20.780 --> 00:49:21.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Meron na ba kayo?

asr-001344
00:49:21.320 --> 00:49:23.560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kaya nung 322 ninyo.

asr-001345
00:49:24.420 --> 00:49:25.320
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, wala pang...

asr-001346
00:49:26.160 --> 00:49:28.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, has anybody been given quick claims or anything?

asr-001348
00:49:29.900 --> 00:49:38.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, for the record, BCDA is saying that they're still currently talking to the affected individuals in our hearing.

asr-001349
00:49:39.200 --> 00:49:41.620
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And this is, of course, before Mr. Nepomuceno's time.

asr-001350
00:49:41.620 --> 00:49:50.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We also enjoined the President then not to do press releases without informing the local leaders first.

asr-001351
00:49:50.680 --> 00:49:55.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because even the mayor of Capas found out about this initiative on the news.

asr-001352
00:49:55.140 --> 00:49:58.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, not even, nobody really talked to him.

asr-001353
00:49:59.160 --> 00:50:03.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But, Mr. President, for the record, wala naman daw pong pinapapirmang quick claim.

asr-001354
00:50:03.300 --> 00:50:04.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, they are denying.

asr-001355
00:50:04.660 --> 00:50:08.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it would be good if we can have another hearing.

asr-001356
00:50:08.540 --> 00:50:14.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we have evidence to this that any quick claims were provided to any of the families there.

asr-001357
00:50:14.640 --> 00:50:19.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Are there any identified potential relocation sites for the affected families?

asr-001358
00:50:20.680 --> 00:50:23.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, possibly.

asr-001359
00:50:24.460 --> 00:50:31.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But, Mr. President, may I also remind everyone that this area is three times the size of BGC.

asr-001360
00:50:31.800 --> 00:50:32.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's right.

asr-001361
00:50:32.400 --> 00:50:41.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, whether these are 300, 500, or 1,000 families, surely there needs to be buy-in, there needs to be consent,

asr-001362
00:50:42.500 --> 00:50:44.900
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and there needs to be a good area for them, no?

asr-001363
00:50:45.160 --> 00:50:47.020
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Or even to carve out their area.

asr-001364
00:50:47.220 --> 00:50:47.360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Correct.

asr-001365
00:50:47.360 --> 00:50:48.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because their area is so huge.

asr-001366
00:50:48.660 --> 00:50:50.660
Senator Imee R. Marcos: We need to derive informed consent.

asr-001367
00:50:50.680 --> 00:50:57.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: There's cost to develop these areas, to provide them with adequate housing, basic utilities, livelihood opportunities, and so on.

asr-001368
00:50:59.280 --> 00:51:06.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I also don't know how you can compensate the burial grounds and the ancestors of some of our IPs.

asr-001369
00:51:06.560 --> 00:51:07.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, that was brought up in the hearing.

asr-001370
00:51:07.880 --> 00:51:10.940
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I suggested we have a burial ground in the middle of this area.

asr-001371
00:51:11.780 --> 00:51:12.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Why not?

asr-001372
00:51:12.260 --> 00:51:12.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Di ba?

asr-001373
00:51:12.480 --> 00:51:18.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I mean, kung yun po yung ayaw hoon nating makatapak sa mga karapatan ng ating IPs.

asr-001374
00:51:18.800 --> 00:51:19.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That area.

asr-001375
00:51:20.680 --> 00:51:26.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: We will not match up to the total area of three times the size of BGC or the size of Malabon.

asr-001376
00:51:27.240 --> 00:51:34.080
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And Mr. President, ito naman, kausap ko rin yung predecessor ni Mr. Nepomoceno and of course the board of BCDA.

asr-001377
00:51:34.460 --> 00:51:36.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Kailangan rin po natin ng transparency dito.

asr-001378
00:51:36.920 --> 00:51:42.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Sa mga hearing po natin, nagbabago-bago rin kung ano ba talaga yung itatayo po dito sa area na to.

asr-001379
00:51:43.140 --> 00:51:46.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Nagsimula yan with data center, marami yung umalma, kasama na po tayo.

asr-001380
00:51:46.920 --> 00:51:49.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And then suddenly in the hearing, wala nang data center.

asr-001381
00:51:49.760 --> 00:51:50.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Naging manufacturing.

asr-001382
00:51:50.680 --> 00:51:52.980
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Pero hindi rin malinaw kung anong klaseng manufacturing.

asr-001383
00:51:54.920 --> 00:51:59.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nakumpisa nga yung manufacturing dun sa critical minerals, di ba?

asr-001384
00:52:00.060 --> 00:52:04.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So Mr. President, I suggested this to the board and of course to the predecessor of Mr. Nepomoceno.

asr-001385
00:52:05.740 --> 00:52:07.440
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mahalaga na malinaw sa taong bayan.

asr-001386
00:52:07.800 --> 00:52:13.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Hindi lang yung mga taong nandun, pero lahat po tayo, kailangan malinaw ano ba talaga itong pinapasok natin.

asr-001387
00:52:14.380 --> 00:52:19.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So at least it's clear to us what the deals are, what the negotiations are.

asr-001388
00:52:19.580 --> 00:52:20.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: At malaman natin.

asr-001389
00:52:21.220 --> 00:52:25.600
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ano ba itong pinapasok po natin dito with the United States?

asr-001390
00:52:25.880 --> 00:52:32.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, but given that this is a budget hearing, in the absence of corresponding budgetary allocation,

asr-001391
00:52:33.360 --> 00:52:38.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: who will shoulder the cost that will inevitably be incurred by the transfer of these people,

asr-001392
00:52:38.880 --> 00:52:42.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: their relocation, the restitution of their livelihoods?

asr-001393
00:52:42.240 --> 00:52:49.120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is it going to be the Philippine government or is it the U.S. or whoever the occupants will be,

asr-001394
00:52:49.120 --> 00:52:52.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: the private and commercial enterprises?

asr-001395
00:52:59.100 --> 00:53:06.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So Mr. President, I've been informed here that any possible locator will be shouldering these expenses.

asr-001396
00:53:07.160 --> 00:53:08.000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So kanya-kanya yun?

asr-001397
00:53:08.600 --> 00:53:12.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, the locators will be funding the development of the area.

asr-001398
00:53:12.860 --> 00:53:16.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The locators will have to fund these financial support programs.

asr-001399
00:53:16.660 --> 00:53:19.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But of course, BCDA is in charge.

asr-001400
00:53:19.120 --> 00:53:24.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: of social preparation and all of the initial talks.

asr-001401
00:53:24.180 --> 00:53:27.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But yung pondo po will be charged to the private sector.

asr-001402
00:53:28.060 --> 00:53:34.560
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dahil kasi, isang bagay yung gastos.

asr-001403
00:53:35.100 --> 00:53:43.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero sa kabila nun, may dapat magagarantiya ng mga karapatan ng mga residents na na-displaced.

asr-001404
00:53:43.300 --> 00:53:47.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Lalong-lalo na yung mga hamak na IP dapat maproteksyonan.

asr-001405
00:53:47.480 --> 00:53:48.900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Meron rin silang karapatan.

asr-001406
00:53:49.120 --> 00:53:54.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Eh kung yung commercial entity lang ang papasok, sinong lalaban para sa kanila?

asr-001407
00:53:54.860 --> 00:53:56.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, good question, Mr. President.

asr-001408
00:53:56.320 --> 00:54:03.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So there's a commitment that BCDA will be handling all of these concerns, no?

asr-001409
00:54:03.980 --> 00:54:08.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: While the locators will be funding the actual physical development of the area.

asr-001410
00:54:08.700 --> 00:54:14.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So BCDA categorically commits that no resident will be displaced,

asr-001411
00:54:14.400 --> 00:54:18.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: no agricultural land will be cleared, and no community be relocated.

asr-001412
00:54:19.120 --> 00:54:25.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Until sufficient funds are secured, and their rights are acknowledged and respected.

asr-001413
00:54:26.040 --> 00:54:29.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, there's a commitment, Mr. President, from BCDA.

asr-001414
00:54:29.880 --> 00:54:37.220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Doon naman sa energy concerns, the proposed hub is projected to require 3 gigawatts of electricity,

asr-001415
00:54:37.900 --> 00:54:42.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which is about 16% of the entire Luzon grid.

asr-001416
00:54:42.180 --> 00:54:46.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Do we have a concrete plan?

asr-001417
00:54:47.080 --> 00:54:49.100
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi nung una narinig ko, may nagbo-volunteer.

asr-001418
00:54:49.120 --> 00:54:53.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Nagpo-volunteer na pumasok, magpo-provide ng power producer siya.

asr-001419
00:54:53.780 --> 00:54:56.260
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pagkatapos nun, parang umatras.

asr-001420
00:54:57.200 --> 00:55:04.840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tapos, how can we produce this huge amount in such a short span of time?

asr-001421
00:55:07.820 --> 00:55:14.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, so galing rin po sa BCDA, nagbabago-bago rin yung porma nito.

asr-001422
00:55:14.120 --> 00:55:14.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay.

asr-001423
00:55:15.040 --> 00:55:18.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But yung 3 gigawatts, they admit that this was stated at some point,

asr-001424
00:55:19.120 --> 00:55:20.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because this could possibly be the need.

asr-001425
00:55:21.300 --> 00:55:25.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But they also mentioned that their plan is not to tap into the Luzon grid,

asr-001426
00:55:25.440 --> 00:55:29.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: but to generate the energy on-site.

asr-001427
00:55:30.720 --> 00:55:32.980
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Tama. Hirap na hirap na nga yung Luzon grid.

asr-001428
00:55:33.300 --> 00:55:36.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At yung Visayas, talagang problematic na.

asr-001429
00:55:36.520 --> 00:55:40.560
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: However, Mr. President, I raised this also, that if that's the case,

asr-001430
00:55:42.640 --> 00:55:45.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: because no power plants are made in 2 years.

asr-001431
00:55:45.460 --> 00:55:47.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Everything takes about 5 years.

asr-001432
00:55:47.540 --> 00:55:49.100
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, this actually means,

asr-001433
00:55:49.240 --> 00:55:52.240
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that the locators will locate there in 5 years.

asr-001434
00:55:52.720 --> 00:55:56.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because if, I mean, that's what it means, Mr. President.

asr-001435
00:55:56.680 --> 00:56:00.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, gaya po ninyo, paibay ba talaga yung mga press release?

asr-001436
00:56:01.460 --> 00:56:04.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Paibay ba rin yung mga sinasabi ng mga leaders dito?

asr-001437
00:56:04.780 --> 00:56:12.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we call for transparency and a clear plan before we move on towards funding this

asr-001438
00:56:12.040 --> 00:56:14.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: or even going the next step, Mr. President.

asr-001439
00:56:14.140 --> 00:56:16.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung Saudi group na sabi,

asr-001440
00:56:17.240 --> 00:56:18.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: awarded na ng 500,

asr-001441
00:56:19.120 --> 00:56:20.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: megawatt solar project.

asr-001442
00:56:21.420 --> 00:56:22.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Totoo ba yun?

asr-001443
00:56:22.500 --> 00:56:23.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Lumabas sa dyaryo yun eh.

asr-001444
00:56:30.780 --> 00:56:34.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, you have the 500 megawatt project na solar?

asr-001445
00:56:34.560 --> 00:56:37.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, there is a, it's prior to the Paxilica announcement.

asr-001446
00:56:37.640 --> 00:56:38.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, okay.

asr-001447
00:56:38.420 --> 00:56:42.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: That's 500 megawatts by the...

asr-001448
00:56:42.840 --> 00:56:44.020
Senator Imee R. Marcos: 5 years daw.

asr-001449
00:56:44.020 --> 00:56:46.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's outside of the Paxilica...

asr-001450
00:56:46.040 --> 00:56:48.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ah, outside of the Paxilica. Walang connection yun.

asr-001451
00:56:49.120 --> 00:56:49.800
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Wala daw po.

asr-001452
00:56:49.800 --> 00:56:53.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi parang nung nasa dyaryo na, parang kinonect sila.

asr-001453
00:56:54.100 --> 00:57:02.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, I think this isn't the only solar or other energy project in the pipeline.

asr-001454
00:57:02.740 --> 00:57:05.080
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero 5 years tulad ng nasabi ninyo.

asr-001455
00:57:05.420 --> 00:57:10.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero in the meantime, BCDA should guarantee there will be no power shortages or electricity

asr-001456
00:57:10.700 --> 00:57:15.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: or electric price hikes in the Luzon grid.

asr-001457
00:57:16.160 --> 00:57:16.640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi ba?

asr-001458
00:57:16.640 --> 00:57:17.360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi,

asr-001459
00:57:18.080 --> 00:57:18.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: ah,

asr-001460
00:57:18.460 --> 00:57:19.700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: papasok tayo nito,

asr-001461
00:57:19.800 --> 00:57:21.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: mahihirapan pala yung buong Luzon.

asr-001462
00:57:22.180 --> 00:57:23.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Meron bang, ah,

asr-001463
00:57:23.780 --> 00:57:29.600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: makukuha tayong panghako galing sa BCDA na hindi naman tayo mape-pervision ng todo-todo?

asr-001464
00:57:30.740 --> 00:57:31.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President,

asr-001465
00:57:32.180 --> 00:57:37.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: I've been informed by the President that all projects have to pass through DOE,

asr-001466
00:57:37.600 --> 00:57:38.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: NGCP,

asr-001467
00:57:39.100 --> 00:57:40.260
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and definitely,

asr-001468
00:57:41.180 --> 00:57:41.860
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: ah,

asr-001469
00:57:42.580 --> 00:57:43.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: an ERC.

asr-001470
00:57:43.380 --> 00:57:45.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Siguro naman,

asr-001471
00:57:45.620 --> 00:57:48.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: hindi kayo gagawa ng proyekto na makaka-apekto sa...

asr-001472
00:57:48.460 --> 00:57:49.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: kabuuhan ng Luzon.

asr-001473
00:57:49.600 --> 00:57:51.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But this is a commitment, of course,

asr-001474
00:57:51.680 --> 00:57:54.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: that they will have to go through the proper regulations

asr-001475
00:57:54.380 --> 00:57:59.180
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: and with the proper understanding that this project is self-generated,

asr-001476
00:57:59.360 --> 00:58:00.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: the energy is self-generated.

asr-001477
00:58:01.160 --> 00:58:02.340
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: On the record, Mr. President,

asr-001478
00:58:02.700 --> 00:58:04.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: yan ang binanggit ni BCDA.

asr-001479
00:58:04.680 --> 00:58:06.000
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay, thank you for that.

asr-001480
00:58:06.160 --> 00:58:08.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the other issue, of course, is water.

asr-001481
00:58:09.420 --> 00:58:12.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Dahil na-anunsyo nung mga

asr-001482
00:58:12.820 --> 00:58:15.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: nagpa-package ng Paxilica

asr-001483
00:58:15.780 --> 00:58:18.300
Senator Imee R. Marcos: that it will require 65 million,

asr-001484
00:58:18.300 --> 00:58:22.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: to 90 million liters of water per day.

asr-001485
00:58:23.060 --> 00:58:26.160
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is this still the BCDA's estimate?

asr-001486
00:58:34.520 --> 00:58:36.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ito ba yung sinasabing yung Kuan?

asr-001487
00:58:36.800 --> 00:58:39.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Magko-construct, mag-surface water?

asr-001488
00:58:39.340 --> 00:58:40.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ah, what project is that?

asr-001489
00:58:42.760 --> 00:58:45.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So there is a current joint venture

asr-001490
00:58:45.840 --> 00:58:48.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: of a Korean firm, K-Water,

asr-001491
00:58:48.140 --> 00:58:51.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: which is outside of the Paxilica area.

asr-001492
00:58:52.460 --> 00:58:53.380
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Tama ba po? Yes.

asr-001493
00:58:53.940 --> 00:58:57.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And the production of this

asr-001494
00:58:57.520 --> 00:59:01.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: is 65 to 90 million liters per day.

asr-001495
00:59:01.500 --> 00:59:03.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So there might have been confusion about...

asr-001496
00:59:04.560 --> 00:59:05.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ito ba yung Kuan?

asr-001497
00:59:05.540 --> 00:59:09.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung sinasabi na surface water harvest and impoundment?

asr-001498
00:59:09.840 --> 00:59:11.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ito yung surface water? Ito na yun?

asr-001499
00:59:11.900 --> 00:59:14.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Mr. President, ang ibig po palang sabihin is that

asr-001500
00:59:14.760 --> 00:59:17.160
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: if ever may needs yung area,

asr-001501
00:59:17.160 --> 00:59:18.120
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: dito po kukunin.

asr-001502
00:59:18.140 --> 00:59:19.400
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it is a new project.

asr-001503
00:59:19.700 --> 00:59:20.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Right.

asr-001504
00:59:20.200 --> 00:59:24.860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And who's going to underwrite this big effort?

asr-001505
00:59:27.100 --> 00:59:28.620
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sino magbabayad niyan?

asr-001506
00:59:28.620 --> 00:59:31.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's a PPP with a Korean company.

asr-001507
00:59:31.820 --> 00:59:35.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, but PPP can take many forms.

asr-001508
00:59:35.140 --> 00:59:36.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano ang...

asr-001509
00:59:36.760 --> 00:59:37.520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ano ang...

asr-001510
00:59:37.520 --> 00:59:38.520
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And Maynilad ba yan?

asr-001511
00:59:39.060 --> 00:59:43.360
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So it's a joint venture between a Korean firm and Maynilad.

asr-001512
00:59:44.660 --> 00:59:46.500
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it's building a facility which will produce...

asr-001513
00:59:46.500 --> 00:59:47.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Lakuha yung Maynilad.

asr-001514
00:59:47.700 --> 00:59:51.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: 65 million to 90 million liters per day.

asr-001515
00:59:51.380 --> 00:59:52.580
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So may gastos rin tayo.

asr-001516
00:59:52.580 --> 00:59:55.880
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And it's awarded already, original proponent status.

asr-001517
00:59:56.040 --> 00:59:59.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But this was done before the PacSilica initiative.

asr-001518
00:59:59.420 --> 00:59:59.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-001519
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:07.140
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's 120 million, which was supposed to, liters a day, which was supposed to augment the shortages in Luzon.

asr-001520
01:00:07.520 --> 01:00:10.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala pa dito yung packed silica na 65 to 90.

asr-001521
01:00:11.260 --> 01:00:13.300
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No, so the production is 65 to 90.

asr-001522
01:00:13.840 --> 01:00:16.060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: No, the production is 120 a day.

asr-001523
01:00:16.840 --> 01:00:24.340
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero yung 120 na yun, pupunuin yung kakulangan ng tubig sa Luzon grid without packed silica pa.

asr-001524
01:00:24.620 --> 01:00:28.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pag may packed silica, may additional 65 to 90.

asr-001525
01:00:28.500 --> 01:00:30.960
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: The need rises, no?

asr-001526
01:00:31.240 --> 01:00:31.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Siyempre.

asr-001527
01:00:35.120 --> 01:00:43.460
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, so they plan to scale up all of these utilities, Mr. President, both in terms of energy and water consumption.

asr-001528
01:00:43.860 --> 01:00:50.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Marami kasi nagtatanong kung talaga yung Bangot, O'Donnell, Abacan Rivers, kaya-kaya niyan,

asr-001529
01:00:50.420 --> 01:00:58.040
Senator Imee R. Marcos: i-supply lahat ng water requirements ng packed silica sa hinaharap nating Super El Nino.

asr-001530
01:00:58.500 --> 01:00:58.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Made by?

asr-001531
01:01:01.720 --> 01:01:10.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Okay, based on the feasibility studies of this joint venture, according to BCDA, kakayaanin naman daw po.

asr-001532
01:01:10.740 --> 01:01:18.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But definitely, now that we're taking this up here, I guess in the hearings, we will have to delve deeper into this to find out.

asr-001533
01:01:18.920 --> 01:01:21.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sana magkaroon ng second hearing. Wala pa kasi yan. Tagal na eh.

asr-001534
01:01:22.400 --> 01:01:27.920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Gusto kong malaman kung meron na talagang impact na pinag-aralan nationally.

asr-001535
01:01:28.500 --> 01:01:35.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Ang irrigation, ang NIA, ang National Water Resources Board, kung i-divert lahat ng tubig nitong ilog natin,

asr-001536
01:01:36.500 --> 01:01:47.720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: anong mangyayari sa existing agricultural irrigation systems, downstream communities, all the existing and overarching water rights?

asr-001537
01:01:47.720 --> 01:01:54.740
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi alam naman natin, heavily populated itong area na ito, higit sa lahat, eto na yung rice basket ng buong Pilipinas.

asr-001538
01:01:55.140 --> 01:01:56.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, definitely.

asr-001539
01:01:56.880 --> 01:01:57.720
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: If I'm not mistaken, the...

asr-001540
01:01:58.500 --> 01:02:07.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Was that the Economic Affairs Committee? May I ask the help of Senate President Gatchalian, that hearing that we had on Pax Inca?

asr-001541
01:02:07.740 --> 01:02:09.000
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Andaming, andaming committee involved.

asr-001542
01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:10.580
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Yes, I think it was the...

asr-001543
01:02:10.580 --> 01:02:12.240
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Senator Raffi on Pax Inca.

asr-001544
01:02:12.240 --> 01:02:15.000
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think Environment, the Committee on Environment.

asr-001545
01:02:15.620 --> 01:02:16.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Committee on Environment.

asr-001546
01:02:16.680 --> 01:02:24.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, I'm sure, Mr. President, we can ask for a second hearing because things are moving.

asr-001547
01:02:24.440 --> 01:02:27.220
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yeah, we actually created a committee of a whole.

asr-001548
01:02:27.340 --> 01:02:27.840
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Ah, okay.

asr-001549
01:02:28.500 --> 01:02:32.840
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because the Pax Inca project is multidimensional.

asr-001550
01:02:33.100 --> 01:02:38.800
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It has economic consequences, it has environmental consequences, it has legal consequences.

asr-001551
01:02:38.800 --> 01:02:40.680
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, we created a committee of a whole.

asr-001552
01:02:40.680 --> 01:02:45.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, we will support, Mr. President, the convening of this committee of the whole at the proper time

asr-001553
01:02:45.740 --> 01:02:52.680
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: so we can have transparency with regard to what it is exactly that we're talking about, Mr. President.

asr-001554
01:02:52.800 --> 01:02:54.240
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, I just looked at my notes.

asr-001555
01:02:54.360 --> 01:02:57.680
Senator Imee R. Marcos: It appears that the proposed K-water and Manila...

asr-001556
01:02:58.500 --> 01:03:07.780
Senator Imee R. Marcos: The joint project involves 14.8 billion pesos with large infrastructure inputs.

asr-001557
01:03:07.780 --> 01:03:14.320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Is any part of this projected capacity earmarked already for Pax Inca?

asr-001558
01:03:15.140 --> 01:03:15.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: No.

asr-001559
01:03:16.060 --> 01:03:16.540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Wala pa.

asr-001560
01:03:16.800 --> 01:03:18.200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi hindi pa maliwanag, no?

asr-001561
01:03:18.300 --> 01:03:23.400
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, this joint project with K-water preceded Pax Inca.

asr-001562
01:03:23.580 --> 01:03:23.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes.

asr-001563
01:03:23.820 --> 01:03:24.640
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, wala pa yun.

asr-001564
01:03:24.640 --> 01:03:27.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: It's initially made for the needs of New Clark City.

asr-001565
01:03:28.060 --> 01:03:28.460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Siguro.

asr-001566
01:03:28.500 --> 01:03:40.820
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, yung mahihingi ko na lamag, e garantiya mula sa BCDA na walang tahanang Pilipino na magkukulang ng tubig.

asr-001567
01:03:40.960 --> 01:03:47.800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: At saka lahat ng magsasaka ay hindi mawawalaan ng akses sa kanilang irigasyon.

asr-001568
01:03:48.760 --> 01:03:53.480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pwede bang hingin ang pangako ninyo kasi marami pang nangangamba?

asr-001569
01:03:53.480 --> 01:03:58.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, yes, the answer is yes.

asr-001570
01:03:58.500 --> 01:04:06.740
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: But we've also been informed here that if the plans of New Clark City for water and electricity come to pass,

asr-001571
01:04:07.240 --> 01:04:11.660
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: there should be an excess even for the neighboring areas.

asr-001572
01:04:12.080 --> 01:04:14.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Of course, yan yung plano, Mr. President.

asr-001573
01:04:14.480 --> 01:04:21.040
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And I think the proper venue would be the Committee on the Whole to go into detail about all of these issues being raised also.

asr-001574
01:04:21.040 --> 01:04:25.180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yes, which is why we need to get that scheduled impeachment or budget.

asr-001575
01:04:25.180 --> 01:04:30.420
Senator Imee R. Marcos: in, uh, um, [unclear] aside.

asr-001601
01:04:30.420 --> 01:04:39.500
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, BCDA provides that guarantee, and I hope no Filipino taxpayer will be required to subsidize the water requirements of PacSilica,

asr-001602
01:04:39.920 --> 01:04:45.940
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which should, instead of burdening us, help us develop our manufacturing capability.

asr-001603
01:04:46.200 --> 01:04:46.960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001604
01:04:46.960 --> 01:04:48.060
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-001605
01:04:48.340 --> 01:04:52.920
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we are with you in a lot of these concerns.

asr-001606
01:04:54.520 --> 01:04:58.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And hopefully, Mr. President, the Senate can be the venue.

asr-001607
01:04:58.140 --> 01:05:04.780
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: For transparency and to really share with the people, ano ba talaga yung mga nakaplano dito, no?

asr-001608
01:05:04.980 --> 01:05:07.220
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And marami pong concerns, no?

asr-001609
01:05:07.220 --> 01:05:13.480
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: There was a recent survey result that came out that majority were not in favor of this initiative.

asr-001610
01:05:14.280 --> 01:05:20.420
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And clarity, I think, will help people understand better kung dapat ba itong masuporta o hindi.

asr-001611
01:05:20.920 --> 01:05:27.140
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: And we have asked, even from the first hearing, our friends from BCDA, and BOI, si Yusek Rodolfo,

asr-001613
01:05:28.140 --> 01:05:35.280
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: To be very clear with ano ba yung mga next steps dito, ano ba yung papasukan natin, ano ba yung goals natin dito.

asr-001614
01:05:35.680 --> 01:05:39.200
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: Because until today, Mr. President, pabago-bago rin yung information, no?

asr-001615
01:05:39.520 --> 01:05:42.760
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, thank you very much to the gentle lady from Ilocos Norte.

asr-001616
01:05:42.760 --> 01:05:45.820
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: She asked me in all of my agencies today.

asr-001617
01:05:45.940 --> 01:05:46.700
Senator Paolo Benigno "Bam" Aquino IV: So, marami salamat.

asr-001618
01:05:47.520 --> 01:05:49.600
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you to the good sponsor.

asr-001619
01:05:49.780 --> 01:05:57.480
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And definitely, once we convene the committee of the whole, we will request the different agencies to give us full,

asr-001620
01:05:58.140 --> 01:06:02.880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: briefing, and the full details of the PacSilica project.

asr-001621
01:06:04.820 --> 01:06:05.080
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alright?

asr-001622
