Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Robin, hindi ka na magtatanong na?

asr-001625
01:06:12.660 --> 01:06:13.240
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Di ka na.

asr-001626
01:06:13.740 --> 01:06:20.980
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So, with that, Mr. President, I move that the budget of the Basis Conversion Development Authority be deemed submitted.

asr-001627
