Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Any objection?

asr-001628
01:06:22.800 --> 01:06:27.800
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Hearing none, the budget of the Basis Conversion and Development Authority is hereby...

asr-001629
01:06:28.140 --> 01:06:28.820
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Submitted.

asr-001630
01:06:29.180 --> 01:06:30.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Thank you very much, Mr. President.

