Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Klarong-klaro naman po yan.

asr-001781
01:15:46.220 --> 01:15:59.000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Under Republic Act 7638, DOE is mainly responsible for energy policymaking, energy security, electricity supply,

asr-001782
