Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: consumer protection and monitoring, among others.

asr-001783
01:16:03.400 --> 01:16:10.920
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: At sa NEA naman, kayo rin po ang responsible sa pag-supervise at monitoring sa performance ng electric cooperatives.

asr-001784
01:16:11.980 --> 01:16:19.460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi nga nila, you cannot compel the NGCP dahil private naman po ito.

asr-001785
