Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Nagpadala po ako ng sulat sa Fibeco kasi yung district area na yun is Fibeco.

asr-001816
01:18:50.120 --> 01:18:52.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So nagpadala ako ng sulat. They gave a lengthy explanation.

asr-001817
01:18:52.640 --> 01:18:54.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: I think one was...

asr-001818
01:18:55.340 --> 01:18:56.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Yun nga, there was an outing.

asr-001819
01:18:56.460 --> 01:18:57.660
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: It's from NGCP.

asr-001820
01:18:58.480 --> 01:19:01.940
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: But it was quick. I think it was only like 20 minutes or something.

asr-001821
01:19:02.820 --> 01:19:06.640
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: Natimingan lang po na nagsispeech si Sen. Bong Go noon na brownout.

asr-001822
