Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: So Mr. President, I know because of the latest of the hour, we just try to lighten the mood.

asr-001833
01:19:39.160 --> 01:19:41.140
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: But definitely we look into it.

asr-001834
01:19:42.260 --> 01:19:43.440
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: To my good colleague.

asr-001835
01:19:43.960 --> 01:19:46.160
Senator Juan Miguel "Migz" F. Zubiri: And I'm sure the Secretary to the NEA will also.

asr-001836
